\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MxbrsZPo2pUQ7kNvwHmFQ36&_nc_oc=Adoz4XroCrBw5NRsGd1dIs7McoCeDe5JyLSdymV9vmVbtqCYvn083ZfCGDqy0JZ0DSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQ1YXOmUQoMedVHMTdgB5RQHPC4AiuADxLVTtqrTXF_A&oe=6B0714F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jA5QWOfzy0wQ7kNvwHuNfwk&_nc_oc=AdouhZSaPOAnF5TJ9uFD8oihUDS4sKr7RPeHDiKeHnW_BjUb26bq22Kk0by1Q0ZtOKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFeTaQaKbLRZlpnvcN1G5NMq_xZDpWqvE71cDUlEpvdA&oe=6B0710F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ARryVHIKHxkQ7kNvwHI7Pkw&_nc_oc=Adpgv3tTB0kNZC_BvpScRsBtzaNxZCKRrQH8IplY1sCDD8PIVZ3KKzZoyy6YLwNsYjk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd5aB1Cipxi7kg8OEvLn_SG_yK8nZPxyaC6np_EDNOzA&oe=6B07157E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u